        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ancient legacy regeneration plan that summons ancient creatures through mystical rituals. And you are unfortunately chosen, and all you have to do is to explore the laboratory in the mist, destroy five totems and kill the bloodthirsty beasts</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Note: The game contains horror and horror elements, and the shooting difficulty is relatively high</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feature: </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leveling up</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Killing zombies and cyborgs can increase combat experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leveling up allows for skill points, improving weapon performance, or enhancing personal abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are nearly 20 types of skill points to choose from, enhancing weapons, melee combat, scavenging, and survival skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick advancement and resource gathering</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The resources on the map are limited and random;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the bullets in the boxes are also random.You must collect the most weapons and resources within a limited time to prepare for confrontation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to challenge hard mode, remember to plan your advance route and manage the consumption of different weapon ammunition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be prepared to face the Bloodthirsty</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Bloodthirsty can launch surprise attacks from the shadows at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After being injured, it will retreat to recover health and attack you again when you are least prepared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can take the initiative to destroy 5 totems to break the Bloodthirsty's armor, or collect heavy weapon ammunition, defend your position</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ancient legacy regeneration plan that summons ancient creatures through mystical rituals. And you are unfortunately chosen, and all you have to do is to explore the laboratory in the mist, destroy five totems and kill the bloodthirsty beasts</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Note: The game contains horror and horror elements, and the shooting difficulty is relatively high</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feature: </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leveling up</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Killing zombies and cyborgs can increase combat experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leveling up allows for skill points, improving weapon performance, or enhancing personal abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are nearly 20 types of skill points to choose from, enhancing weapons, melee combat, scavenging, and survival skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick advancement and resource gathering</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The resources on the map are limited and random;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the bullets in the boxes are also random.You must collect the most weapons and resources within a limited time to prepare for confrontation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to challenge hard mode, remember to plan your advance route and manage the consumption of different weapon ammunition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be prepared to face the Bloodthirsty</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Bloodthirsty can launch surprise attacks from the shadows at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After being injured, it will retreat to recover health and attack you again when you are least prepared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can take the initiative to destroy 5 totems to break the Bloodthirsty's armor, or collect heavy weapon ammunition, defend your position</p>",
        "short_description": "This is a horror shooting game that confronts dark creatures.An ancient legacy regeneration plan that summons ancient creatures through mystical rituals. And you are unfortunately chosen, and all you have to do is to explore the laboratory in the mist, destroy five totems and kill the bloodthirsty",
